{"id":"cd296d089f11f5f2","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-seq-prefix.md","title":"ZFC Seq Prefix","display":"df-zfc-seq-prefix — ZFC Seq Prefix","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-prefix","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-prefix"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-prefix — ZFC Seq Prefix","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-seq-restriction-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-prefix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-prefix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-prefix — ZFC Seq Prefix"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a99fa823030978de\" href=\"?note=a99fa823030978de\" title=\"58-df-zfc-seq-restriction-sequence\">58-df-zfc-seq-restriction-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,s\\in V\">\\(p,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqRestrictionSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqRestrictionSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqPrefix}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqPrefix}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}prefix} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqPrefix}_S(p,s)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(p))\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(s))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqRestrictionSequence}_S(p,s,\\operatorname{dom}(p))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}prefix} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqPrefix}_S(p,s)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(p))\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(s))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqRestrictionSequence}_S(p,s,\\operatorname{dom}(p))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ordinal domains ensure that restriction gives an initial segment, not an arbitrary subdomain agreement.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-seq-restriction-sequence","status":"reso